.TH HAMSTIK 1 "HAMSTIK ATTRIBUTE PROJECT ENABLE"
.SH NAME
hamstik attribute project enable \- Enable one Attribute for the selected Project
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B hamstik attribute project enable [OPTIONS]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Enable one Attribute for the selected Project
.SH ARGUMENTS
.TP
.I KEY
Stable Attribute key
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B --reason
Optional audit reason
.TP
.B --idempotency-key
Explicit idempotency key
